<title>BELGIUM: Sabena CEO named chairman of charter subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Sabena CEO named chairman of charter subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Reutlinger, chief executive officer of Belgian national airline Sabena, has also been named chairman of Sabena's charter subsidiary Sobelair, the carrier said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Reutlinger succeeds Andre Pahaut, who had asked to be relieved of his function for personal reasons but will carry on as director of Sobelair, owned 72.38 percent by Sabena.</p>
